            "comment": "There are several different issues shown in this selection. (1) there are disconnected amber paths which do have faint lines between them, such that they shouldn't be broken. (2) some of the elevation lines are interrupted by buildings. (3) some building label numbers (e.g. 1) have been accidentally detected as contour lines. Please build some simple UI that will let me use my human vision and judgement to work with the image processing tools to clean this up.",
